flowchart LR
    A[Raw text] --> B[Normalize and clean]
    B --> C[Tokenize: BPE / WordPiece]
    C --> D[Token IDs]
    D --> E[Embeddings]
    E --> F{Model era}
    F -- Classical --> G[TF-IDF + linear model]
    F -- Neural --> H[RNN / LSTM]
    F -- Modern --> I[Transformer encoder/decoder]
    G --> J[Task head]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K[Classification / NER / generation]
    K --> L[Evaluate: F1 / BLEU / perplexity]
